  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Cut sweet potato and carrot into small chunks. Cut capsicum into bite-sized chunks. Cut brown onion into thick wedges.\n• Place prepped veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and the honey. Season with salt and pepper, then toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 25-30 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the veggies between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/643504479182522a7c056f1b/step-42490bf6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, drain sweetcorn. Set aside.\n• SPICY! This is a mild spice blend, but use less if you're sensitive to heat. In a medium bowl, combine Tex-Mex spice blend and a drizzle of olive oil. Season, then add plant-based crumbed chicken. Toss to coat. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/643504479182522a7c056f1b/step-4b919675.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat a large frying pan over high heat. Cook corn kernels until lightly browned, 4-5 minutes. Transfer to a second medium bowl. TIP: Cover the pan with a lid if the corn kernels are popping \"out.\"",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/643504479182522a7c056f1b/step-bd594911.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side. Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate. TIP: The spice blend will char slightly in the pan, this adds to the flavour!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/643504479182522a7c056f1b/step-9e53576a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the tray with roasted veggies, add baby spinach leaves and charred corn.\n• Drizzle with olive oil, then gently toss to coat. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/643504479182522a7c056f1b/step-f09a4d82.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide roast veggie toss between plates. Top with Tex-Mex chick'n.\n• Serve with a dollop of garlic sauce. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/643504479182522a7c056f1b/step-eb8a0fa9.jpg"
    }
  ]
